            "review_title": "Review at Cafe Dung Dinh",
            "review_text": "Justin Hewett\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam276 contributions\n1\nClosing time?\nSep 2020 • Friends\nI hate giving places the dreaded “1 star” review, but this place deserves it. \n\nI drove here today (Sunday) and arrived at 4:52pm with a friend. Upon arrival, I was told they were already closed. I spoke to the manager (who refused to give me his name) who also said they were closed. I asked why they were closed before there stated/online closing time of 5pm and he wouldn’t answer either of us. He wants to go home, I get it. But... This is not the way a business is supposed to run. 5pm means 5pm, not 4:58, 4:59, etc.\nRead more\nWritten September 27, 2020",
